notes:        Original clean-room English-to-Arabic translation of the full 3,704-string
              reference catalog, using ordinary Arabic video-editing vocabulary (NLE-style
              terms: تسلسل، مجلد، مسار، تصيير، رأس التشغيل، شفرة القص). No proprietary
              localisation resource, string table or product interface was consulted.
              Reviewed against the tests and validated for 100% catalog coverage.
